# Code owners for outcrop-labs/talaria.
#
# WHAT THIS FILE IS FOR. The branch rulesets (testing-review on testing,
# rc-main-review on rc and main) require one approval from a code owner before a
# pull request merges. That review binds the authors who are not admins: the
# Talaria GitHub App, an agent's account, any future bot. Admins bypass the
# review, and only through a pull request; nobody bypasses the required checks.
# Without this file "a code owner's approval" names nobody, and the rule either
# blocks every merge or proves nothing.
#
# WHY ONE LINE. The owners are the repository's three admins (decision D16), and
# all three own all of it. A per-path map is for the day an area has an owner
# who is not all three. A later, more specific pattern overrides this one, so
# such a map adds lines below it.
